A('1961-early-return', '1961', VH, 'Tens of thousands driven into the land-development and "prosperity" zones of Long Khốt, Mộc Hóa, Thành Phước, Canal 12, Vàm Xáng, Cà Ná and Gò Ông Lê rise early in the year, break up large parts of the zones and go back to their old villages.', 'III, 140', when='1961, early', at='before 1961-01', also=['vietnam'], tags=['ok:fields-place'], check='the day; the history names the zones, not the provinces.')
A('1961-07-thuanan', '1961-07', VH, 'Thủ Dầu Một. In the stretch of July to October the province\'s local troops and guerrillas beat the Saigon side\'s clearing of the Thuận An Hòa forest.', 'III, 154', when='July–Oct.', place='thu-dau-mot', also=OP, check='the day.')
A('1961-07-tuacau', '1961-07', VH, 'Thủ Dầu Một. In the stretch of July to October the province\'s forces destroy the Saigon side at Tua Cầu and Trại Cưa.', 'III, 154', when='July–Oct.', place='thu-dau-mot', also=OP, check='the day; the history gives no figures.')
A('1961-07-thachan', '1961-07', VH, 'Thủ Dầu Một. In the stretch of July to October the province\'s forces ambush military vehicles at Thạch An.', 'III, 154', when='July–Oct.', place='thu-dau-mot', also=OP, check='the day.')
A('1961-07-benthe', '1961-07', VH, 'Bến Cát. In the stretch of July to October Company 304 of the province, with the guerrillas of Tân An commune, with a man inside the post, destroys two Saigon platoons at the Bến Thế post.', 'III, 154', when='July–Oct.', place='ben-the', also=OP, check='the day.')
A('1961-07-phuan', '1961-07', VH, 'Bến Cát. In the stretch of July to October a guerrilla squad of Phú An commune drives back a Saigon platoon and eight bulldozers brought to clear the ground for a strategic hamlet. Huỳnh Văn Đảnh is later named a Hero of the People\'s Armed Forces.', 'III, 154', when='July–Oct.', place='ben-cat', names=['Huỳnh Văn Đảnh'], also=OP, check='the day.')
A('1961-late-mytuong', '1961', VH, 'Ninh Thuận. At the end of the year Battalion 120 sends half its force to the north of the province, destroys the Mỹ Tường post and ambushes the relief, hurting a reinforcing Civil Guard company of the Phan Rang subsector.', 'III, 162', when='1961, late', at='before 1961-09', place='ninh-thuan', also=OP, check='the day.')
A('1962-0420-dienngoc', '1962-04-20', VH, 'Quảng Nam. Apr. 20 a Saigon commando company and nearly a platoon of Civil Guard and Self-Defense men surround a squad of seven sappers under Lê Tấn Hiền and Võ Như Hưng, with three cadres of Điện Bàn, in Hamlet 4, Điện Ngọc commune. The ten fight all day, from a dry well in the middle of a field, against a force 50 times theirs; at night they draw the Saigon side off and get out with the wounded. Over 100 of the Saigon side killed, by the history\'s count; four of the ten dead, one wounded.', 'III, 173–74', place='dien-ngoc', tags=['ok:fields-time'], names=['Lê Tấn Hiền', 'Võ Như Hưng'], also=OP)
A('1962-03-binhduong', '1962-03', VH, 'Bình Dương. In the stretch of March to June the province\'s people hold 38 rallies and demonstrations and 1,072 direct struggles with the Saigon government, against the Sunrise campaign and for the dissolving of the strategic hamlets.', 'III, 171', when='Mar.–June', place='binh-duong', also=['vietnam'], check='the day; the figures are the history\'s.')
A('1962-03-binhduong-b', '1962-03', VH, 'Bình Dương. In the stretch of March to June, while Saigon sweeps, the province\'s troops and militia fight 253 actions: 300 of the Saigon army and 7 military vehicles destroyed, by the history\'s count.', 'III, 171', when='Mar.–June', place='binh-duong', also=OP, check='the day.')
A('1962-1026-exhibit', '1962-10-26', VH, 'Saigon. The Saigon government holds an exhibition of the armed forces\' "achievements" before the City Hall, with modern arms, for the national day. Commandos of Team 155 throw grenades at the helicopter on show and kill Maj. Phan Bội Ngọc, who was giving the commentary; the exhibition is closed that day.', 'III, 185', place='saigon', names=['Phan Bội Ngọc'], also=OP + ['vietnam'], check='the American record not read.')
A('1962-12-bachdang', '1962-12', VH, 'Saigon. In December Saigon\'s commandos kill eight American advisers with grenades at the Bạch Đằng wharf.', 'III, 185', when='Dec.', place='saigon', also=OP + ['vietnam'], check='the day; the American record not read.')
A('1962-12-cancer', '1962-12', VH, 'Saigon. In December commandos kill six Americans with grenades near the Cancer Institute and the Bảy Hiền crossing.', 'III, 185–86', when='Dec.', place='saigon', also=OP + ['vietnam'], check='the day; the American record not read.')
A('1962-12-truongtanbuu', '1962-12', VH, 'Saigon. In December commandos kill ten American advisers in a villa at the corner of Trương Tấn Bửu and Ngô Đình Khôi streets.', 'III, 186', when='Dec.', place='saigon', also=OP + ['vietnam'], check='the day; the American record not read.')
A('1963-05-tamky', '1963-05', VH, 'Quảng Nam. In May, at the time of the Măng Xim fight, the province\'s local forces and guerrillas go down to the stretch of Route 1: 32 hamlets of 12 communes west of Tam Kỳ rise and take power; some targets in the town are raided and the Mò O strongpoint destroyed.', 'III, 253', when='May', place='tam-ky', also=OP, check='the day; the history puts it at the time of the Măng Xim fight, May 4–15.')
A('1963-05-reg42', '1963-05', VH, 'Kon Tum. Regiment 42 of the Saigon army sweeps the base area north of Kon Tum, to relieve the pressure on the Đắk Pét post and to back the Civil Guard in holding strategic hamlets. Battalion 407 (sappers) joins Battalion 200 and the sweep is beaten: hundreds put out of action, many arms and goods taken, by the history\'s count.', 'III, 245', when='May', place='kontum', also=OP, check='the day; the history does not date the sweep and puts it after the Đắk Pét attack of May 1963.')
A('1963-1h-sonduong', '1963', VH, 'Bình Thuận. In the first months of the year the province\'s armed forces in the base area beat three operations of the Saigon 3d Division: Sơn Dương I, Sơn Dương II and Bình Lâm.', 'III, 259', when='1963, early', at='before 1963-01', place='binh-thuan', also=OP, check='the days.')
A('1963-hangto', '1963', VH, 'Region 6. Battalion 840 of the region takes the Hằng Tổ strongpoint by surprise and ambushes a column of 21 military vehicles on Route 21, to draw Saigon forces off, and helps the Bahnar to kill oppressors and break up a concentration zone.', 'III, 260', when='1963', also=OP, tags=['ok:fields-place'], check='the day; the history gives neither the date nor the province.')
A('1963-baosen', '1963', VH, 'Bình Thuận. After hurting the Phi Long and Phi Hổ strongpoints, the province\'s troops with Bắc Bình district\'s ambush a convoy of military goods at Bàu Sen, on Route 1, and destroy a Civil Guard company and four Self-Defense platoons sweeping, taking 160 infantry weapons. They then strike the Bình Lâm post and hurt a Civil Guard company there.', 'III, 260', when='1963', place='binh-thuan', also=OP, check='the day.')
A('1963-mid-suoiket', '1963', VH, 'Bình Thuận. In the middle of the year the province\'s troops with Tánh Linh district\'s beat a sweep by two Civil Guard companies led by the Tánh Linh district chief at Suối Kết, and the people of the hamlets rise.', 'III, 260', when='1963, mid', at='before 1963-05', place='binh-thuan', also=OP, check='the day.')
A('1963-07-tohap-end', '1963-07', VH, 'Khánh Hòa. After 38 days of an operation by 2,500 Saigon main-force men with air and artillery, under Gen. Tôn Thất Đính, on the base area in the Tô Hạp river basin, Đính orders the withdrawal, the plan given up. The people had blocked the paths with crossbows, stone traps and spike pits; the guerrillas of the highlands sniped at the columns; hundreds of Saigon soldiers dead, by the history\'s count.', 'III, 260–61', when='July, early', place='to-hap', names=['Tôn Thất Đính'], also=OP, check='the day: the history gives 38 days from the opening, June 1 ([[cal.1963-06-01.vietnam-hanoi-2]]), which makes about July 8.')
K('cal.1963-06-01.vietnam-hanoi-2', 'Check: the history places this operation, under Tôn Thất Đính, in the Khánh Hòa base area of the Tô Hạp basin (III, 260), not in Bình Thuận; its account runs 38 days.')
A('1963-0710-qnqnbd', '1963-07', VH, 'Quảng Ngãi, Bình Định. In the stretch of July to October the two provinces hold 1,524 direct struggles against the Saigon side, over a million people in all, and destroy strategic hamlets 1,876 times: over 400 of the 900 built, by the history\'s count.', 'III, 254', when='July–Oct.', place='quang-ngai-province', also=['vietnam'], check='the day; the figures are the history\'s.')
